	title = {Continued Fractions and What Can Be Done with Them},
	year = {2021},
	abstract = {We begin with a less formal introduction to continued fractions and the underlying concepts to be used in this book. The goal of this chapter is to illustrate and highlight the main aspects of the topics that will be considered. This will hopefully also serve as a motivation to struggle with unavoidable details that will occur later, and aims to provide a guideline for the ideas, concepts and results ahead.},
